 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Data Cleaning — Advanced Notebook\n",
    "\n",
    "Notebook interaktif untuk kasus lanjutan: normalisasi timestamp timezone, dedup transaksi, konversi mata uang, deteksi outlier, dan QA.\n",
    "**Petunjuk:** File > Save a copy in Drive sebelum mulai. Jalankan sel satu per satu (Shift+Enter)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1) Muat data sample transaksi\n",
    """
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "\n",
    "df = pd.read_csv('06-data-cleaning/data/sample_transactions.csv', dtype=str)\n",
    "# trim whitespace\n",
    "df = df.applymap(lambda v: v.strip() if isinstance(v, str) else v)\n",
    "df.head()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2) Parsing timestamp (utc-aware) & numeric casting"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# parse timestamps (coerce invalid)\n",
    "df['event_time'] = pd.to_datetime(df['event_time'], errors='coerce', utc=True)\n",
    "# numeric\n",
    "df['amount'] = pd.to_numeric(df['amount'], errors='coerce')\n",
    "df[['tx_id','event_time','amount']].head()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3) Deteksi duplikat & resolusi (completeness score)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# lihat duplikat\n",
    "dups = df[df.duplicated(subset=['tx_id'], keep=False)]\n",
    "dups[['tx_id','user_id','event_time','amount','currency']]\n",
    "\n",
    "# completeness score dan keep most complete then latest\n",
    "cols = ['user_id','event_time','amount','currency']\n",
    "df['completeness'] = df[cols].notna().sum(axis=1)\n",
    "df = df.sort_values(['tx_id','completeness','event_time'], ascending=[True, False, False])\n",
    "df = df.drop_duplicates(subset=['tx_id'], keep='first').reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    "df.head()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4) Konversi mata uang ke USD (contoh mapping sederhana)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "fx = {'USD':1.0, 'IDR':1/15000.0}  # contoh, gunakan table FX nyata di produksi\n",
    "df['amount_usd'] = df.apply(lambda r: float(r['amount']) * fx.get(r['currency'], np.nan) if pd.notna(r['amount']) else np.nan, axis=1)\n",
    "df[['tx_id','amount','currency','amount_usd']].head()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5) Deteksi outlier per bulan (IQR)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df['month'] = df['event_time'].dt.to_period('M')\n",
    "grp = df.groupby('month')['amount_usd']\n",
    "q1 = grp.quantile(0.25)\n",
    "q3 = grp.quantile(0.75)\n",
    "iqr = q3 - q1\n",
    "bounds = pd.DataFrame({'q1':q1,'q3':q3,'iqr':iqr}).reset_index()\n",
    "df = df.merge(bounds, left_on='month', right_on='month', how='left')\n",
    "df['is_outlier'] = ((df['amount_usd'] < (df['q1'] - 1.5*df['iqr'])) | (df['amount_usd'] > (df['q3'] + 1.5*df['iqr'])))\n",
    "df[['tx_id','amount_usd','is_outlier']]"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6) Laporan QA singkat & simpan hasil"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print('Null rates:')\n",
    "print(df.isna().mean())\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Daily counts:')\n",
    "print(df.groupby(df['event_time'].dt.date).size().tail())\n",
    "\n",
    "df.to_csv('06-data-cleaning/data/sample_transactions_cleaned.csv', index=False)\n",
    "print('Selesai. File disimpan: 06-data-cleaning/data/sample_transactions_cleaned.csv')"
   ]
  }
